# ==============================================================================
# EnvoyTrade PostgreSQL Nightly Maintenance Cron Job
#
# TIMING RATIONALE:
# - Indian Commodity Market (MCX) trades until 11:30 PM / 11:55 PM IST.
# - Scheduled at 01:00 AM IST to run strictly after all equity and commodity
#   markets have completed post-market settlement, avoiding trading day lockups.
# ==============================================================================
#
# Option A: If server timezone is set to Asia/Kolkata (IST):
# 01:00 AM IST daily
0 1 * * * envoytrade /usr/local/bin/envoytrade-db-maintenance >> /var/log/envoytrade/maintenance.log 2>&1
#
# Option B: If server timezone is set to UTC:
# 20:30 UTC = 01:00 AM IST next day
# 30 20 * * * envoytrade /usr/local/bin/envoytrade-db-maintenance >> /var/log/envoytrade/maintenance.log 2>&1
